{
 "_doc": "Passive icons (docs/ART_RULES.md: Menus), built by tools/art/build_ui.py. crit: Critical strike (the Crit Chance card): a blade's point striking a bright spark. belt_of_strength: Belt of Strength: a broad leather belt with a bronze buckle. winged_sandals: Winged Sandals (the winged sandals Hermes lends Perseus): a sandal with a white wing at the heel. hourglass: Hourglass: sand running through, in a wooden frame. seers_eye: Seer's Eye: a wide eye with a bright blue iris. lodestone: Lodestone: a dark magnetic stone drawing in specks of gold. bronze_aegis: Bronze Aegis: a round bronze shield with a boss. ferrymans_coin: Ferryman's Coin (the obol paid to Charon): a silver coin with an owl's eyes struck on it. golden_apple: Golden Apple: a golden apple with a leaf. votive_bell: Votive Bell: a small bronze temple bell. mirrored_shield: Mirrored Shield (Perseus' polished shield): a round shield polished bright, with a gleam. tyrs_oath: Tyr's Oath (Tyr's hand pledged in Fenrir's jaws): an open right hand, raised. pomegranate_seed: Pomegranate Seed (Persephone's pomegranate): a split pomegranate, its red seeds showing. whetstone_shard: Whetstone Shard (Hrungnir's whetstone, Skaldskaparmal 17): a grey shard of whetstone with a lightning spark. green_girdle: The Green Girdle (Sir Gawain and the Green Knight): a green silk girdle tied in a knot, gold at its ends. plant_of_youth: Plant of Youth (Epic of Gilgamesh, Tablet XI): a thorny sprig drawn up from the deep, with green leaves. elk_skis: Elk-Hunter's Skis (Kalevala 13-14, Lemminkainen's chase): a pair of long wooden skis, tips curled up. white_div_blood: White Div's Blood (the Shahnameh, seventh labour): a pale drop that restored the blinded king's sight. firebird_feather: Firebird's Feather (the Russian tales): a feather that shines like fire. oeyama_sake: Oeyama Sake (the Oeyama tale): a red lacquered sake cup. laevateinn_shard: Laevateinn Shard (Fjolsvinnsmal): a shard of a blade of flame. yggdrasil_dew: Dew of the Ash (Gylfaginning 16): a drop of honeydew falling from a green ash leaf. golden_key: The Golden Key (the legend of Ys): the golden key of the sea gates. roc_feather: Roc's Feather (the Thousand and One Nights): a huge brown feather. sun_crow_feather: Sun-crow Feather (the Huainanzi; the Chuci commentary): a black feather of a crow from the sun, gold-tipped. loose_thread: Loose Thread (the Unweaver, the game's own): a loose thread unravelling from a spool. hunters_horn: Hunter's Horn (the Wild Hunt: the horns heard all night, the Anglo-Saxon Chronicle 1127): a curved hunting horn. mountebanks_charm: Pedlar's Charm (Carmilla, ch. 5: the hunchbacked pedlar's charms against the oupire): a little rolled paper charm on a cord. wolf_tooth: Wolf's Tooth (the Beast of Gevaudan): a long white fang. iron_claw: Iron Claw (Black Annis): three long curved iron claws. draupnir: Draupnir (Skaldskaparmal 35): the gold ring from which eight more of the same weight drip every ninth night. tarnkappe_thread: Tarnkappe Thread (the Nibelungenlied): a wisp of the grey cloak of invisibility, half there. glow_cap: Glow-cap (Mycendra, the game's own): a small mushroom glowing pale green. ant_strength: Ant's Strength (Herodotus' gold-digging ants): an ant carrying a lump of gold bigger than itself. elf_arrow: Elf-arrow (the charm \"Wid faerstice\": the elves' arrows): a small flint arrowhead, as the old \"elf-shot\" stones. rhymers_tongue: Rhymer's Tongue (Thomas the Rhymer: given a tongue that cannot lie): a harp of Elfland, small and green-gold. thunderstone: Thunderstone (Ovid: Zeus' thunderbolt on Lycaon's house): a dark stone crackling with a jagged bolt. iolaus_brand: Iolaus' Brand (Apollodorus 2.5.2: the brands that seared the Hydra's necks): a burning torch. torn_banner: Torn Banner (Ghorvast, the game's own): a ragged red war banner on a broken pole. ariadne_thread: Ariadne's Thread (Plutarch, Theseus 19): a ball of red thread, the end trailing away. drinking_horn: Drinking Horn (Gylfaginning 46-47: the horn whose end was in the sea): a curved horn with a silver rim. scabbard_strap: Scabbard Strap (Malory: the scabbard of Excalibur): a red jewelled scabbard on its strap. talos_nail: Talos' Nail (Apollodorus 1.9.26): the bronze nail that stopped the giant's one vein. silver_penny: Silver Penny (Rossetti, Goblin Market: Lizzie's silver penny): a small silver coin. kraken_ink: Kraken Ink (Pontoppidan: the Kraken): a curling dark tentacle in a cloud of ink. billinas_egg: Billina's Egg (Baum, Ozma of Oz): a hen's egg, the thing the Nomes fear most.",
